  "prefLabel": "Plc 102.25 Office or other place of business",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 102.25 “Office or other place of business” means:\n\n(a) The primary location where a licensee practices or otherwise engages in the occupation or profession; or\n\n(b) For those occupations and professions for which the licensee goes to the client’s premises or otherwise has a mobile operation, the location that serves as a licensee’s base of operations.\n\nSource. #14135, eff 12-1-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc100-200.html"
